      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "In her first year, @SecretaryLCD has delivered major results for both American workers and businesses: \n\n✅ Completed 50-state America at Work listening tour\n✅ Registered over 3,000 new apprenticeship programs nationally\n✅ Added over 350,000 new apprentices \n✅ Invested MILLIONS in skills training for in-demand jobs \n✅ Partnered with the Department of Education to improve workforce pipelines\n✅ Launched a proposal to expand prescription drug price transparency \n✅ Clawed back BILLIONS in unspent COVID funds\n✅ Eliminated discriminatory DEI \n✅ Promoted retirement security \n✅ Announced 63 deregulatory actions to cut red tape and spur job creation \n\nWe’re not tired of winning and will keep up the fight to Put American Workers First 🇺🇸",
